  "intro": "AI is an especially strong Schols topic because it connects **finance, employment, corporate responsibility, government power, energy policy and Ireland's economic model**. The strongest approach is not to argue that AI is simply good or bad. Instead, examine who captures its benefits, who carries its costs, and who should be accountable when its development creates risks.",
